{"_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "New Interests and Aspirations"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Vanessa's Career Move"}, {"type": "position", "content": 5}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 4}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": " Understand detailed descriptions of real or imaginary events and experiences in present, past or future and in spoken or written texts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": " Understands the main ideas and specific information of complex text on both concrete and abstract topics in written texts in social and work contexts."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn10le04ob05re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "  Future Time Clauses:  Before, After"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "  You use time clauses to give information about time and sequence."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the words If, When, Before and After in time clauses.<br/>Future time clauses explain what needs to happen or which condition needs to be satisfied before a future event can occur."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the first conditional with these time clauses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Structure: <br/> <ul>If/When/Before/After + Subject + Simple Present tense, Subject + will/be going to + Simple Present tense"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Before</span> means at an earlier time. An action in the future needs to be completed before the action introduced by the time clause can occur. <br/> Example: <br/> <ul> <span class=\"italic\">Before I tell you what my aspirations are, I want to say that I find mindfulness very useful.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> After</span> means at a later time. The action introduced by the time clause will lead to another action right after it is completed. <br/> Example: <br/>  <ul><span class=\"italic\">After you share your presentation, we will have a little celebration.</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">If</span> means on the condition that ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">When</span> means at the time of doing something."}, {"type": "example", "content": "When you leave here today, I know you will each have what it takes to reach your ultimate goals. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "After you share your presentations, we will have a small ceremony and reception to celebrate the completion of this course."}, {"type": "example", "content": "I will register for the certificate when this course ends today!"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Using Sequencing Connectors to  Explain and Supporting Your Ideas"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use contrast connectors to express your position and to show another point of view. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Connectors can show a connection to what you want to say and what was said before. They can also show your position and opinion on a particular situation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Sequencing connectors are usually placed at the beginning of a sentence and provide a logical sequence between statements, or provide a link with a previous statement or sentence.  <br/><br/> Structure:  <br/><ul><span class=\"italic\"> Initial Sentence. <span class=\"strong\">Sequencing Connector</span>, + phrase. <span class=\"strong\">Sequencing connector</span>, etc.</span></ul> <br/>Look at the chart for some common sequencing connectors:<br/>"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sequencing Connector\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Sequencing Connector\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" first/firstly, first of all\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" For one thing\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" second/secondly\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" In addition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" third, in the third place\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Furthermore\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" also\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Moreover\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" besides\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Finally\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": " For one thing, you have proven that you are all courageous, dynamic and unique individuals."}, {"type": "example", "content": " In addition, I've achieved a deeper level of honesty and discovered what my true hopes are. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Moreover, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Finally, I also realized something surprising: I have decided I would like to start a family within the next five years. "}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "fulfilling"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "making you \u200bfeel \u200bhappy and \u200bsatisfied"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Working with you over the past week has been a fulfilling experience for me."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use to talk about presentations."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to reap the benefits"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "what you gain after your hard labor put in"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hope you all reap the benefits of your experiences here."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "individual"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a \u200bsingle \u200bperson or thing, \u200bespecially when \u200bcompared to the \u200bgroup or set to which they \u200bbelong"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are all courageous, dynamic and unique individuals. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tremendous"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "very \u200bgreat in \u200bamount or \u200blevel, or \u200bextremely good"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The past week has given me tremendous insight into the way I think ."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to peer into "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to look very carefully into something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: In particular, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to hinder "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200blimit the \u200bability of someone to do something, or to \u200blimit the \u200bdevelopment of something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I discovered the lies and fears that have hindered me from taking the next step."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to admit"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to \u200bagree that something is \u200btrue, \u200bespecially \u200bunwillingly"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I admitted to myself that I am quite driven."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "driven"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "determined to \u200bachieve something or be \u200bsuccessful "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I am quite driven."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "completion"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the \u200bact of \u200bfinishing something that you are doing or making"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We will have a small ceremony and reception to celebrate the completion of this course."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn10le04ob05aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of your goals for your future career and personal life. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Plan and write a presentation explaining what your future. (Use when, as soon as, before, after etc.)"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice your presentation."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Present your presentation to a group and try not to read from your notes."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I plan and write about the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about hopes, plans and expectations for the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I present my prepared presentation."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le04ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Working with you over the past week has been a fulfilling experience for me, and I hope you all reap the benefits  of your experiences here. For one thing, you have proven that you are all courageous, dynamic and unique  individuals. When you leave here today, I know you will each have what it takes to reach your ultimate goals. After you share your presentations, we will have a small ceremony and reception to celebrate the completion of this course. Let's begin the presentations with Vanessa.", "id": 1, "time": "200", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Hi everyone. To start with, I'd like to thank you Amy and each one of you in this room for being incredibly inspirational.The past week has given me tremendous insight into the way I think . In addition, I've achieved a deeper level of honesty and discovered what my true hopes are. Before I tell you what my aspirations are, I want to say that the most useful session for me was the one on mindfulness.", "id": 2, "time": "30000", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\"></span>Moreover, learning to meditate allowed me to peer into my soul and discover the lies and fears that have hindered me from taking the next step. I have defined three clear objectives. The most immediate one is that I want return to school to get a restaurant management certificate. Finally, I also realized something surprising: I have decided I would like to start a family within the next five to seven years! I admitted to myself that I am quite driven and have a picture of what happiness and success is for me. My third objective is to create, own, and manage my own gourmet restaurant. I will register for the certificate when this course ends today!", "id": 3, "time": "59000", "image": "engenn10le04ob05re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about education and character traits."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can discuss plans, hopes and expectations for the future."}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What is one of the most fulfilling experiences you've had?"}, {"type": "Free Header Item", "content": " What are three long-term goals that you have? Explain."}, {"type